message: "If you use this software or its methods, please cite it as below."
title: "conformal-selective-uq: mechanism-validated selective conformal regression with conditional coverage under shift"
abstract: >-
  A portable, pre-registered selective conformal regression method that holds
  group-conditional coverage under documented distribution shift and is
  mechanism-validated against a known irreducible-noise floor, demonstrated on
  cross-sectional financial allocation reconstruction.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Niles
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-01"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - selective prediction
  - conditional coverage
  - distribution shift
  - uncertainty quantification
  - quantile regression
repository-code: "https://github.com/niles-liu/conformal-selective-uq-public"
